# Pairs with NoCrossTenantMembership. Count a replicated entry naming
# another tenant's group: a group-aware probe that takes any live slot.
MODULE: GroupMatchSkipsAdmissibility
TARGET: NoCrossTenantMembership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the group-aware admin and member probes skip the admissibility filter
PERTURBS: Count

--- FIND
        viaGroup == {e \in Entries : e \in groups /\ Admissible(e) /\ live(e)}
--- REPLACE
        viaGroup == {e \in Entries : e \in groups /\ live(e)}
--- END